[en.DECISION_ENABLE_LANDLORD]
Allow Core

[en.DECISION_ENABLE_LANDLORD_desc]
(After clicking a state, you can build core or claim by toggling the interface at upper-right of the lower-left state info window. This feature comes from the landlord MOD)

[zh.DECISION_ENABLE_LANDLORD]
允许造核

[zh.DECISION_ENABLE_LANDLORD_desc]
（点击一个地块后，在窗口左下角地块信息的右上部分，可以展开造核、制造宣称等功能。来自landlord模组）
